  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Back Nine Boys stands for optimism at the most average level of golf. We may not be good, but the next shot could be a great one and hole 10 is always a fresh start in our eyes. Front nine flops only focus on competition and course etiquette. Back Nine Boys live and breathe to take $1 off a buddy, and competition comes second to good times and tactful trash talk.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We couldn&rsquo;t find hats that we wanted to wear. At one end, you have brand hats with shoddy quality that make it feel like you&rsquo;re trying too hard and on the other you have expensive, $70 hats without any connection to how we play the game. We custom made Back Nine Boys hats to be the best of both worlds. Engineered with waterproof, laser vented, antimicrobial, and sweatband comfort material at the highest possible quality that is built to last. We love wearing our hats and we know you will too.</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Product description: Waterproof, laser-vented, sweat and stain resistant hats at an affordable price<br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Waterproof, laser-vented, sweat and stain resistant hats at an affordable price. Fun golf brand with high quality products.<br>&bull; Payment terms:&nbsp;<br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n</div>",
